# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Tesseract VERTEX — Standalone Demo Edition
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This demo version operates 100% client-side using browser localStorage.
# No cloud databases, remote servers, backend APIs, or environment secrets are required.
#
# You can deploy directly to Vercel or run locally with `npm run dev`
# without setting any environment variables.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

